+First forced-native run, p50:
+
+| General workload | Grain | Native tier | Result |
+| --- | ---: | ---: | --- |
+| Mixed integer/float calculation | 60.848 us | 3.507 us | 17.35x |
+| Array/map/string processing | 7.625 us | 7.054 us | 7.49% lower time |
